to the RO drain line for a quieter, simpler setup with fewer components. Both options are crafted from high-quality materials for long-lasting durability, corrosion resistance, and reliable performance in your home.</p><p></p><p></p>","width":"33%","alignment":"center","align_text":"left","text_size":"medium","text_color":"black","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"sf__btn-primary","button_size":"","block_custom_class":"","animations":"inherit"}},"979f1bfd-af62-4755-9994-f6879636c93c":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify://shop_images/RO_Faucet_Types.jpg","link":"","width":"66%","alignment":"center","block_custom_class":"","animations":"inherit"}},"template--16026561315007__a1aeac2b-f20d-4ef1-8da0-8ab6bd7492b6-168314279250fab381-0":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"<h3 style=\"color: #0AAFA2; font-weight: bold;\">RO Faucet Types</h3>","subheading":"","text":"<h3>Understanding Airgap vs Non-Airgap<strong> </strong></h3><p><br/>An airgap faucet includes a small built-in gap of air that prevents wastewater from flowing back into your RO system, adding an extra layer of protection and meeting most local plumbing codes. A non-airgap faucet, on the other hand, connects directly to the RO drain line for a quieter, simpler setup with fewer parts. Both are built with high-quality materials to ensure long-lasting performance</p>","width":"33%","alignment":"center","align_text":"left","text_size":"medium","text_color":"black","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"sf__btn-primary","button_size":"","block_custom_class":"details","animations":"inherit"}},"7043ffb4-1f13-4535-985e-e5cd899f6a00":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify://shop_images/Which_RO_Faucet_Type_Do_I_Need.jpg","link":"","width":"66%","alignment":"center","block_custom_class":"","animations":"inherit"}},"f5c04800-559b-41f3-9466-57adb830001d":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"<h3 style=\"color: #0AAFA2; font-weight: bold;\"> Whats Right for You?</h3>","subheading":"","text":"<h3>Choose What\u2019s Right for Your Home</h3><p>Choosing between an airgap and non-airgap faucet depends on your setup and preferences. An <strong>airgap faucet</strong> provides added protection against backflow and is often required by local plumbing codes. A <strong>non-airgap faucet</strong> offers a cleaner look, quieter operation, and simpler installation. Both are engineered for reliable performance, ensuring your RO system runs smoothly and your water stays pure..</p>","width":"33%","alignment":"center","align_text":"left","text_size":"medium","text_color":"black","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"sf__btn-primary","button_size":"","block_custom_class":"","animations":"inherit"}},"image_4Xx6EJ":{"type":"image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify://shop_images/Color_Match_Guarantee_1.jpg","link":"","width":"66%","alignment":"center","block_custom_class":"","animations":"inherit"}},"text_TMTkbM":{"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"<h3 style=\"color: #34A3EF; font-weight: bold;\">Guarantee Color Match</h3>","subheading":"","text":"<h3>Match Kitchen Countertop  Fixtures<br/></h3><p><br/>Our Guarantee Color Match ensures every Metpure branded kitchen fixtures\u2014from faucets to soap dispensers and RO faucets\u2014have a perfectly coordinated color scheme. This creates a smooth, seamless look that enhances the overall beauty of your kitchen. By choosing our Guarantee Color Match kitchen fixtures, you\u2019re not just getting a color-matched set; you\u2019re investing in a kitchen design that radiates harmony and sophistication, elevating the entire space to a professional standard. </p>","width":"33%","alignment":"center","align_text":"left","text_size":"medium","text_color":"inherit","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"m-button--primary","button_size":"","block_custom_class":"","animations":"inherit"}},"d646d63f-486a-466e-8876-4ea27ae7f6f8":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify://shop_images/Airgap_Installation_Sequence.jpg","link":"","width":"66%","alignment":"center","block_custom_class":"hidden md:block","animations":"inherit"}},"2af0babf-c49a-467d-b835-c2263851b3a1":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"<h3 style=\"color: #0AAFA2; font-weight: bold;\">Easy Install</h3>","subheading":"","text":"<h3>Hassle-Free Installation</h3><p>Our water filtration faucet comes with everything you need for an easy, hassle-free installation. With all components included\u2014and a handy wrench tool provided\u2014you can complete setup in just a few simple steps. Connect it to your existing filtration system in minutes and enjoy cleaner water, faster..</p>","width":"33%","alignment":"center","align_text":"left","text_size":"medium","text_color":"black","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"sf__btn-primary","button_size":"","block_custom_class":"","animations":"inherit"}},"fdf8c4cf-dbeb-4b12-90af-a58cfe1f06ab":{"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"<h3 style=\"color: #4AA3A1; font-weight: 400;\">Warranty</h3>","subheading":"","text":"<h3><strong>Is your faucet protected in case of defect?</strong></h3><p>Ensure that the wholesale water filtration faucet comes with a warranty or guarantee. This will provide your customers with added peace of mind and protection in the event of any defects or issues.</p><p></p>","width":"50%","alignment":"center","align_text":"left","text_size":"medium","text_color":"black","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"sf__btn-primary","button_size":"","block_custom_class":"","animations":"inherit"}}},"block_order":["b43c0f1b-a02a-4ba3-aaf7-03d3d6e39423","e278aefe-95e4-4d6d-8f98-19be397f3385","979f1bfd-af62-4755-9994-f6879636c93c","template--16026561315007__a1aeac2b-f20d-4ef1-8da0-8ab6bd7492b6-168314279250fab381-0","7043ffb4-1f13-4535-985e-e5cd899f6a00","f5c04800-559b-41f3-9466-57adb830001d","image_4Xx6EJ","text_TMTkbM","d646d63f-486a-466e-8876-4ea27ae7f6f8","2af0babf-c49a-467d-b835-c2263851b3a1","fdf8c4